nu_1 dmenuItems ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder_mMenu_5\" href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/gpage_node-rdareas_societal_wp-url-htm_societal_waterpurification_htm.html\" target=\"_self\" style=\"border-style:none;font-size:1em;\">Water Purification (Chemical Engineering)</a></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width:100%;\"><a class=\"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder_mMenu_1 dmenuItems ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder_mMenu_5\" href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/gpage_node-academics-url-htm_academics_acsir_htm.html\" target=\"_self\" style=\"border-style:none;font-size:1em;\">AcSIR @CSIR-IICT</a></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width:100%;\"><a class=\"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder_mMenu_1 dmenuItems ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder_mMenu_5\" href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/gpage_node-outreach-url-htm_0_htm.html\" target=\"_self\" style=\"border-style:none;font-size:1em;\">CSIR-800</a></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width:100%;\"><a class=\"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder_mMenu_1 dmenuItems ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder_mMenu_5\" href=\"javascript:__doPostBack('ctl00$ContentPlaceHolder$mMenu','outreach\\\\outreach_iict\\\\outreach_iict_resfoundation')\" style=\"border-style:none;font-size:1em;\">IICT Research Foundation</a></td><td style=\"width:0;\"><img src=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/webresource.axd-d-vac5rpidtq6grmd8i5gdodbmjhpvseufk3rvxntpg492rt-bjtkjwoptut46-zviqu6bicmx8zipgdrrg2ip7sckpqi1-t-636284831597151108.jpg\" alt=\"Expand IICT Research Foundation\" style=\"border-style:none;vertical-align:middle;\"/></td>\n                                                            CSIR-Indian Institute of Chemical Technology (IICT), since its inception in 1944,\r\n                                        <div id=\"ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder_divMarq\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"IICT Logo\" src=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/images/iictlogo.ico\" width=\"15px\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#000080; text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/viewfile.aspx-docid-1610047670.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Recognition to FluroOrganic group on the Occasion of Ozone Day Celebrations </a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"IICT Logo\" src=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/images/iictlogo.ico\" width=\"15px\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#000080; text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/viewfile.aspx-docid-1605050328.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Issue of Opinion Reports on classification of chemicals</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"IICT Logo\" src=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/images/iictlogo.ico\" width=\"15px\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\r\n                                        <a href=\"http://www.iictindia.org/docs/csir-iict-vishakapatnam.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">CSIR-IICT Industry Liaison Centre at Visakhapatnam</a>\r\n\t\t                                        \tCSIR declaration from the directors conference held at Dehradun during 12-13th June, 2015. \r\n                                        Inauguration of update CSIR-IICT website portal by Dr. G.N. Qazi, Vice Chancellor, Jamia Hamdard University at National Institute of Biologicals Noida\r\n                                        Inauguration of CSIR-IICT R&D Hub Intranet website portal by Dr. Sri. S. Narsing Rao, IAS, Principal Secretary ro Chief Minister, Telangana State, Hyderabad\r\n\t\t                                        <a href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/gpage_node-academics-url-htm_academics_overview_htm.html\" target=\"_self\" style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:none;\">Ph.D ADMISSIONS IN CHEMICAL AND BIOLOGICAL SCIENCES ARE OPEN FOR THE CANDIDATES HAVING VALID FELLOWSHIP (CSIR-UGC, DST-INSPIRE, ICMR OR ANY OTHER EQUIVALENT Ph.D FELLOWSHIP). FOR FURTHER DETAILS CONTACT BY EMAIL <span style=\"color:Yellow;\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"c9a8a8bc89a0a0aabde7bbacbae7a0a7\">[email&#160;protected]</span></span></a>\r\n                                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/images/best-la.png\" alt=\"CSIR\" width=\"500\" style=\"border:solid 1px blue; cursor:pointer;\" onclick=\"javascript:window.open('https://www.iictindia.org/best.html','_blank');\"/>&nbsp;\r\n                                                Research Highlights</p>\r\n\t\t<td style=\"text-align:justify;font-family: calibri;\">CSIR-IICT Platinum Jubilee International Conference on Advances in \r\n\t\t<td style=\"text-align:justify;font-family: calibri;\">CSIR Tech Awards-2018 for their contribution to  “Technology Transfer for C &#8230; <a href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/viewfile.aspx-docid-1808275829.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">more</a></td>\r\n\t\t<td style=\"text-align:justify;font-family: calibri;\">CSIR Tech Awards-2018 for their nomination entitled  “Innovative, low cost  &#8230; <a href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/viewfile.aspx-docid-1808275826.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">more</a></td>\r\n                    <td id=\"ctl00_fmi\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; vertical-align: middle;\"><a href=\"http://www.csir.res.in/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:none;\">CSIR</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/iictnews_opt-seminar.html\" target=\"_self\" style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:none;\">Events</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/contacts.html\" target=\"_self\" style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:none;\">Contact Us</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.iictindia.org/gpage_node-mmi-url-htm_0_htm.html\" target=\"_self\" style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:none;\">Feedback</a> | <img alt=\"fbfmi\" title=\"CSIR-IICT Facebook\" src=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/images/fb03.png\" style=\"width:20px;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:middle;\" onclick=\"javascript:window.open(&quot;http://www.facebook.com/iictindia&quot;,&quot;_blank&quot;);\"/> | <img alt=\"twfmi\" title=\"CSIR-IICT Twitter\" src=\"https://www.iictindia.org/files/images/twitter.jpg\" style=\"width:20px;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:middle;\"